{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Castles of War is a side-scrolling real-time strategy game of conquest, courage, and creation. Raise armies, command formations, and fight across hand-crafted pixel battlefields in a war-torn fantasy world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Castles of War, you control your kingdom from the front lines. Rally troops, build outposts, and break enemy lines in a dynamic battlefield where timing, positioning, and resource management decide victory. The battlefield evolves as you fight. You can burn bridges, level forests, and watch as your enemy's fortifications crumble.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Gameplay</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical side-scrolling RTS combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A massive collection of hand-crafted missions with mod support for community-created ones</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three asymmetric factions\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build, reinforce, and siege</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Formation-based command</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environmental manipulation (destroy tall grass and build bridges over water)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A living battlefield that evolves with each clash</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spiritual successor to our first game, Trenches of War</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Help Shape the Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Community is at the center of all games by Vashta Entertainment. Your feedback will help us shape the game from through demo, early access, and full-release phases. Help us build something you\u2019ll be proud to have influenced and excited to recommend to others.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please consider\u00a0Wishlisting to support development and join our community to share feedback.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\"